## Goal
Build the market-metrics stock research platform.
Remove all RAWG/game references and replace with FMP API/stocks.
The app must run and show a working stock search grid before this 
step is considered done.

## Scope — Do NOT go beyond this
- No Supabase, no AI, no analytics, no watchlist yet
- No UI color changes — functional first

## Do Not
- Use axios — native fetch only
- Use REACT_APP_ prefix
- Expose MASSIVE_API_KEY to the browser
- Commit broken code
- Touch dev or main branch

---

## Task 1 — Update package.json
Change name to "market-metrics"

