## Task 3 — Massive API client
Replace src/api/API.ts entirely:

Export one function: searchStocks({ query, page })
- Calls /api/stocks (local proxy route)
- Returns { results: StockResult[], total: number }

Export type StockResult:
{
  ticker: string
  name: string
  market: string
  locale: string
  primary_exchange: string
  type: string
  active: boolean
  logo_url?: string
  description?: string
}

---

## Task 4 — Massive proxy API route
Replace app/api/games/route.ts with app/api/stocks/route.ts:
- Delete app/api/games/route.ts
- Create app/api/stocks/route.ts
- GET handler that calls:
  https://api.polygon.io/v3/reference/tickers
  with params:
    apiKey: process.env.MASSIVE_API_KEY
    market: stocks
    active: true
    search: (from query param, if provided)
    limit: 20
    cursor: (for pagination, if provided)
- Return the Massive API response as-is
- Handle errors with appropriate status codes

